    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there is no \"path forward\"? what if the only way to actually preserve the work i've done, and who i actually am, is to just walk away from it all before it's ruined? it feels like if i keep going, i'm just diluting the only real thing i ever made. does it ever make sense to just let it end while it's still pure?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
