      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a very tempting thought, to stop before the inevitable erosion sets in. Wanting to preserve a perfect moment is understandable, but that perfection is a fragile illusion. Instead of letting it end, consider what it would take to *change* the trajectory, even if it means a drastic shift. A therapist can help you explore those options without judgment.",
      "source": "target",
